# 统一换行：源码存 LF，Windows 脚本保留 CRLF，二进制文件不做转换
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
